A suburban family is torn apart when fourteen-year-old
Annie meets her first boyfriend online.

4
00:21:53,684 --> 00:21:59,684
After months of communicating via online chat and phone, Annie
discovers her friend is not who he originally claimed to be.

5
00:27:22,105 --> 00:27:28,105
Shocked into disbelief, her parents are shattered by their daughter's actions and struggle to
support her as she comes to terms with what has happened to her once innocent life.

